<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. O&apos;Keeffe returns four weeks after her first aflibercept injection. Lines on her canvases look less bent with the left eye, and the gray spot is smaller. She had a small red patch on the white of the eye after the injection that faded within a week, and no pain, redness, or loss of vision. Her daily Amsler checks show no change in the right eye. She takes the AREDS2 supplement every day and is still painting daily. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Less distortion and a smaller central spot in the left eye</td></tr><tr><td>After the first injection</td><td>Small red patch on the white of the eye that faded within a week; no pain or vision loss</td></tr><tr><td>Amsler grid</td><td>Daily checks; right eye unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>Adherence</td><td>AREDS2 supplement daily</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

